      "content": "It's common to experience a sense of emptiness and questioning when life's purpose is unclear. Feeling like you're not being watched or guided can be unsettling. Acknowledging these feelings and giving them space can be the first step to finding a new sense of direction and meaning. Sometimes, allowing yourself to explore and experiment can help uncover your passions and values that give your life significance.",
